1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,980
This bunker has room

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,460
for 100,000 people.

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,880
And every single one

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,600
is empty. …almost.

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,720
The blast door won't seal

6
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,990
until it's full.

7
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,870
So who sleeps down here?

8
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:11,560
You.

9
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,400
Everyone who follows

10
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,040
gets a bed

11
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,190
with their name on the door.

12
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:16,290
At 1,000

13
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:17,420
the lights come on.

14
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,500
At 10,000

15
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,880
the air starts flowing.

16
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,420
And at 100,000

17
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,120
the door seals

18
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,460
and we wait out

19
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,340
the end of the world.

20
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:26,870
But there's something

21
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:28,300
I haven't told you.

22
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:29,080
We thought this bunker

23
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,740
had seven levels.

24
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:31,600
Then we found

25
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:32,670
an eighth.

26
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:33,690
There was only one bed

27
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:34,650
down there.

28
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:35,960
Bed 0.

29
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:36,820
Its door was locked

30
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,340
from the inside.

31
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:39,900
So we welded

32
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,460
the hatch shut.

33
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:42,250
Pick your spot

34
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:43,510
in the comments.

35
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:44,850
By the garden

36
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,410
next to the armory

37
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:47,670
or on B7

38
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:49,540
right above bed 0.

39
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,000
Follow me

40
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:50,820
and get inside

41
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,760
before the door closes.
